---
// Hero Section
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero__ascii" aria-hidden="true">
      <pre>
     ▄████████  ███           ▄████████    ▄████████ ███▄▄▄▄      ▄████████
     ███    ███  ███          ███    ███   ███    ███ ███▀▀▀██▄   ███    ███
     ███    █▀   ███          ███    ███   ███    ███ ███   ███   ███    █▀
    ▄███▄▄▄      ███          ███    ███  ▄███▄▄▄▄██▀ ███   ███   ███
    █▀   ███     ███        ▀███████████ ▀▀███▀▀▀▀▀   ███   ███ ▀███████████
    ███    ███   ███          ███    ███ ▀███████████ ███   ███          ███
    ███    ███   ███▌    ▄    ███    ███   ███    ███ ███   ███    ▄█    ███
    ██████████   █████▄▄██    ███    █▀    ███    ███  ▀█   █▀   ▄████████▀
                  ▀                        ███    ███
      </pre>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero__title">
      <span class="text-accent cursor-blink">Elegant Automata</span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="hero__tagline">
      Weld it, code it, scrutinize it.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__terminal">
      <div class="terminal-window">
        <div class="terminal-window__bar">
          <div class="terminal-window__dots">
            <span class="terminal-window__dot terminal-window__dot--red"></span>
            <span class="terminal-window__dot terminal-window__dot--yellow"></span>
            <span class="terminal-window__dot terminal-window__dot--green"></span>
          </div>
          scrutinizer — zsh
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-window__body">
          <p><span class="terminal-window__prompt"></span> whoami</p>
          <p class="text-dim">You are the Central Scrutinizer. It is your responsibility to enforce<br>the laws of Conceptual Continuity inside the audio graph.</p>
          <p class="text-dim" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="terminal-window__prompt"></span> cat /etc/motd</p>
          <p class="text-green">Real-time, hi-fi AI modular music engine.</p>
          <p class="text-dim">Autonomous composition. Style-aware groove engines.<br>Xenochronic metric phasing. All running on your own hardware,<br>in your own garage, under your own terms.</p>
          <p class="text-dim" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="terminal-window__prompt"></span> <span class="cursor-blink"></span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a href="#what" class="btn btn--primary">./explore</a>
      <a href="#tracker" class="btn btn--secondary">./status</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 80vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero__ascii {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero__ascii pre {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    padding: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .hero__title {
    font-size: 4rem;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero__tagline {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .hero__terminal {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero__terminal .terminal-window__body {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero__cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }

  .btn--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .btn--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-green);
    border-color: var(--color-green);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .btn--secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--color-border-hover);
  }

  .btn--secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero__title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    .hero__ascii pre {
      font-size: 0.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>